    "Speaker": "narrator",
    "Text": "Near the trophy case, {president} adjusts a badge that already owns the hallway.",
    "Shot": "pan"
   },
   {
    "Speaker": "@president",
    "Text": "Council isn't a club. It's triage. Panic goes left; ambition goes right; you go where I point.",
    "Shot": "close"
   },
   {
    "Speaker": "@president",
    "Text": "I like students who keep the school pretty and the ranking ugly. Quietly.",
    "Shot": "over_shoulder"
